the System class for quick handling of common operations\nL54: with files and directories\nL55: * the PEAR base class\nL56: Features in a nutshell:\nL57: * full support for channels\nL58: * pre-download dependency validation\nL59: * new package.xml 2.0 format allows tremendous flexibility while maintaining BC\nL60: * support for optional dependency groups and limited support for sub-packaging\nL61: * robust dependency support\nL62: * full dependency validation on uninstall\nL63: * remote install for hosts with only ftp access - no more problems with\nL64: restricted host installation\nL65: * full support for mirroring\nL66: * support for bundling several packages into a single tarball\nL67: * support for static dependencies on a url-based package\nL68: * support for custom file roles and installation tasks\nL69: » Maintainers  | » More Information\nL70: --- | ---\nL71:   * 【20†Chuck Burgess】 [【27†Wishlist】] (lead)\nL72:   * (lead, inactive)\nL73:   * (lead, inactive)\nL74:   * (developer, inactive)\nL75:   * (helper, inactive)\nL76:   * (helper, inactive)\nL77:   * (lead, inactive)\nL78:   * (lead, inactive)\nL79:   * (helper, inactive)\nL80:   * (lead, inactive)\nL81:   * (lead, inactive)\nL82:  |\nL83: \nL84:   * 【28†Browse the source tree†github.com】\nL85:   * 【29†RSS release feed】\nL86:   * 【30†View Download Statistics】\nL87:   * 【31†Build status†test.pear.php.net】\nL88: \nL89: * * *\nL90: #### Packages that depend on PEAR\nL91:   * 【32†Cache】\nL92:   * 【33†Cache_Lite】\nL93:   * 【34†CodeGen】\nL94:   * 【35†CodeGen_MySQL】\nL95:   * 【36†CodeGen_MySQL_Plugin】\nL96:   * 【37†CodeGen_MySQL_UDF】\nL97:   * 【38†CodeGen_PECL】\nL98:   * 【39†Contact_AddressBook】\nL99:   * 【40†Crypt_DiffieHellman】 (versions <= 0.2.5)\nL100:   * 【41†Crypt_HMAC2】\nL101:   * 【42†Date_Holidays】\nL102:   * 【43†DB】\nL103:   * 【44†DB_ldap】\nL104:   * 【45†File】 (versions <= 1.4.0alpha1)\nL105:   * 【46†File_CSV】\nL106:   * 【47†File_DNS】\nL107:   * 【48†File_Fortune】 (versions <= 0.9.0)\nL108:   * 【49†F